// Private messaging, pages, refusals, and gagging across mock sessions.

// Whisper delivery reaches the target.
@nonprogrammer
% whisper hello there to #102
=You whisper, "hello there" to Test Programmer.

@programmer
@text Test Player whispers, "hello there"

// Page delivery: the target hears the origin line and the page text.
@nonprogrammer
% page #102 with a private hello
=Your message has been sent.

@programmer
@text You sense that Test Player is looking for you in Test Chamber.
@text It pages, "a private hello"

// Refused whispers and pages report the refusal to the sender.
% @refuse whispers pages from #101 for 2 hours
~~Refusal of Test Player
; return #102.refused_actions;
{{"whisper", "page"}}

@nonprogrammer
% whisper sneaking to #102
=Test Programmer refuses your whisper.

% page #102 with another hello
=Test Programmer refuses your page.

@programmer
% @unrefuse whispers pages from #101
=Refusals removed.
; return #102.refused_origins;
{}

// Pages to a player with no connection report absence.
@nonprogrammer
% page #110 with anyone there
=Guest is not currently logged in.

// Gagging suppresses room speech from the gagged player.
@programmer
; return #102:set_gaglist(#101);
{#101}

@nonprogrammer
% say you cannot hear me
=You say, "you cannot hear me"

@programmer
% say checking the gag
=You say, "checking the gag"

@nonprogrammer
@text Test Programmer says, "checking the gag"

// The gagged player's speech was not delivered: lifting the gag lets it through.
@programmer
; return #102:set_gaglist();
{}

@nonprogrammer
% say now you can hear me
=You say, "now you can hear me"

@programmer
@text Test Player says, "now you can hear me"

// Confirmation can preserve or clear every refusal without losing parallel state.
@programmer
% @refuse page for 2 hours
~~Refusal of Everybody
% @refusals
~~Everybody:  page
>> no
% @unrefuse everything
=Do you really want to erase all your refusals? [Enter `yes' or `no']
=OK, no harm done.
; return player.refused_origins;
{#-1}
>> yes
% @unrefuse everything
=Do you really want to erase all your refusals? [Enter `yes' or `no']
=OK, they are gone.
; return {player.refused_origins, player.refused_actions, player.refused_until, player.refused_extra};
{{}, {}, {}, {}}

// Spurn commands block acceptance until removed.
% @spurn #105
~~You are now spurning
; return player:acceptable(#105);
false
% @spurn !#105
~~You are no longer spurning
; return player.spurned_objects;
{}
